### ============================================================================
### ADVANCED TEST SCENARIOS
### ============================================================================
### Casos de uso complejos y flujos completos

@api = https://servicioshilda.orioncaribe.com/api/v1

### ============================================================================
### SCENARIO 1: COMPLETE USER REGISTRATION & LOGIN FLOW
### ============================================================================
### Simula el flujo completo de un nuevo usuario

### Step 1: Check API health before starting
GET {{@api}}/health

###

### Step 2: Register new user
POST {{@api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser_{{$timestamp}}",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!",
  "email": "user_{{$timestamp}}@example.com"
}

### Save accessToken from response:
### @accessToken = <response: body $.accessToken>

###

### Step 3: Verify user is authenticated
GET {{@api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{@accessToken}}

###

### ============================================================================
### SCENARIO 2: WALLET LOGIN WITH SIGNATURE
### ============================================================================
### Proceso de login con firma de Solana Wallet

### Step 1: Get challenge for wallet
GET {{@api}}/auth/challenge/4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8

### Response includes: challenge (string to sign), nonce

###

### Step 2: Sign challenge with Solana Wallet (offline process)
### This would be done in the frontend with Phantom/Solflare
### Simulating with a pre-signed message:

POST {{@api}}/auth/login-wallet
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "publicKey": "4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8",
  "message": "login-nonce-123456789",
  "signature": "5K1fvW2xY3zZ4aA5bB6cC7dD8eE9fF0gG1hH2iI3jJ4kK5lL6mM7nN8oO9pP0qQ1rR2sS3tT4uU5vV6wW7xX8yY9zZ"
}

###

### ============================================================================
### SCENARIO 3: COMPLETE PURCHASE FLOW
### ============================================================================
### Flujo completo de compra de tokens

### Step 1: Check current token price
GET {{@api}}/purchase/price

###

### Step 2: Initiate purchase (requires authentication)
POST {{@api}}/purchase/initiate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{@accessToken}}

{
  "walletAddress": "4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8",
  "paymentMethodId": "solana",
  "solAmount": 0.5,
  "slippageTolerance": 0.05
}

### Response includes: transactionId, transactionBase64
### Save: @transactionId = <response: body $.transactionId>

###

### Step 3: Sign transaction with wallet (offline in frontend)
### Then confirm the purchase:

POST {{@api}}/purchase/confirm/{{@transactionId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletAddress": "4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8",
  "transactionHash": "5K1fvW2xY3zZ4aA5bB6cC7dD8eE9fF0gG1hH2iI3jJ4kK5lL6mM7nN8oO9pP0qQ1rR2sS3tT4uU5vV6wW7xX8yY9zZ",
  "signature": "5K1fvW2xY3zZ4aA5bB6cC7dD8eE9fF0gG1hH2iI3jJ4kK5lL6mM7nN8oO9pP0qQ1rR2sS3tT4uU5vV6wW7xX8yY9zZ"
}

###

### Step 4: Monitor purchase status
GET {{@api}}/purchase/status/{{@transactionId}}

###

### Step 5: Verify tokens received
GET {{@api}}/prowallet/holder/4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8

###

### ============================================================================
### SCENARIO 4: TOKEN TRANSFER FLOW
### ============================================================================
### Transferencia de tokens entre wallets

### Step 1: Initiate transfer
POST {{@api}}/transfer/initiate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{@accessToken}}

{
  "fromWallet": "4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8",
  "toWallet": "ABC123DEF456GHI789JKL012MNO345PQR678STU9",
  "amount": 100
}

### Save: @transferId = <response: body $.transactionId>

###

### Step 2: Sign and confirm transfer
POST {{@api}}/transfer/confirm/{{@transferId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromWallet": "4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8",
  "signature": "5K1fvW2xY3zZ4aA5bB6cC7dD8eE9fF0gG1hH2iI3jJ4kK5lL6mM7nN8oO9pP0qQ1rR2sS3tT4uU5vV6wW7xX8yY9zZ",
  "transactionHash": "5K1fvW2xY3zZ4aA5bB6cC7dD8eE9fF0gG1hH2iI3jJ4kK5lL6mM7nN8oO9pP0qQ1rR2sS3tT4uU5vV6wW7xX8yY9zZ"
}

###

### Step 3: Verify balances updated
GET {{@api}}/prowallet/holder/4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8

###

### ============================================================================
### SCENARIO 5: TOKEN WITHDRAWAL FLOW
### ============================================================================
### Retiro de tokens on-chain

### Step 1: Request withdrawal
POST {{@api}}/exchange/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{@accessToken}}

{
  "amount": 500,
  "to": "ABC123DEF456GHI789JKL012MNO345PQR678STU9"
}

### Save: @withdrawalId = <response: body $.withdrawalId>

###

### Step 2: Monitor withdrawal status
GET {{@api}}/exchange/withdraw/status/{{@withdrawalId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{@accessToken}}

###

### Step 3: Verify transaction on-chain
POST {{@api}}/solana/rpc
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "getTokenAccountBalance",
  "params": ["ABC123DEF456GHI789JKL012MNO345PQR678STU9"]
}

